{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e12-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "是金子就会发光的  (True Gold Always Shines)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a quiet teahouse, Xin Huimei meets young singer Bai Yang—unaware that Luo Lin coached her behind the scenes—and hears how last year's Twelve Singers clash scared every record label away from signing her. Listen to Xin Huimei and her manager in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你这么好的姑娘，我为什么不见呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "去年一面之缘之后，很久没有你的消息了，过得还好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "去年的事我当然记得，那段时间心情不好，惹了不少事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "好了，别说了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不是想参加十二歌王吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "杰瑞，是我。我有一个外卡歌手，需要参加第一期的录制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "外卡？每个导师确实有个外卡名额，但是你之前已经放弃了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "而且节目组那边把所有的流程都安排好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我不管，你去处理吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这个圈子没有所谓的江湖规矩，你也不用瞻前顾后。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "是金子就会发光的，别的不用理它。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "来，喝茶。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你这么好的姑娘，我为什么不见呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why wouldn't I meet such a talented young woman?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "去年一面之缘之后，很久没有你的消息了，过得还好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since our brief encounter last year, I haven't heard news of you in ages — how have you been?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "去年的事我当然记得，那段时间心情不好，惹了不少事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course I remember last year; I was in a bad mood back then and stirred up plenty of trouble.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "好了，别说了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, say no more.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不是想参加十二歌王吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Didn't you want to compete on Twelve Singers?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "杰瑞，是我。我有一个外卡歌手，需要参加第一期的录制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello? It's me — I have a wild-card singer who needs to join our Episode One taping.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "外卡？每个导师确实有个外卡名额，但是你之前已经放弃了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A wild card? Every mentor does get one wild-card spot, except you already waived yours earlier.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "而且节目组那边把所有的流程都安排好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Besides, the production crew has already locked in the entire taping rundown.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我不管，你去处理吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't care — go work it out with them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这个圈子没有所谓的江湖规矩，你也不用瞻前顾后。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There are no unwritten underworld rules in this industry, so stop worrying over every step.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "是金子就会发光的，别的不用理它。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'True gold will always shine — ignore everything else.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "来，喝茶。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here, have some tea.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你这么好的姑娘，我为什么不见呀？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "去年一面之缘之后，很久没有你的消息了，过得还好吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "去年的事我当然记得，那段时间心情不好，惹了不少事。",
